            "default_value": "<p><strong>Set a meeting<\/strong> with business development manager Maverick Frame Studio to discuss your project:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Learn about all the <strong>advantages of BIM modeling<\/strong> over traditional drawings.<\/li>\r\n<li><strong>Get an insight<\/strong> into the work of our team.<\/li>\r\n<li>During the meeting, we will <strong>showcase real projects<\/strong> completed using BIM.<\/li>\r\n<li>Find out how BIM modeling can specifically <strong>benefit your business<\/strong> or project.<\/li>\r\n<li>Find out why digital models <strong>help reduce time<\/strong> in design, approval, and execution.<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>",
