            "default_value": "<ul>\r\n        <li>We do not focus on time zones, which is why we work with clients from <strong>all over the world<\/strong><\/li>\r\n        <li><strong>BIM modeling eliminates errors<\/strong> in drawings, but as a design and architecture studio, we also have our own set of rules that are strictly followed by our team. This helps reduce errors in project design to zero.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Our team is multilingual, and we speak the most widely used languages: <strong>English, Spanish, Turkish, German, and French<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n        <li>The ratings on <strong>Trustpilot and Google<\/strong> speak for themselves. Our projects are located all over the world: Germany, the USA, the UK, Cameroon, Malta, the UAE, France, the Netherlands, Sweden, Saudi Arabia, Ethiopia, Canada, Australia, Austria, Benin, Singapore, Finland, Belgium, Switzerland, Lithuania, Denmark, Ireland, and Nova Scotia.<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>",
            "tabs": "all",
            "toolbar": "full",
            "media_upload": 1,
            "delay": 0
        },
