            "aria-label": "",
            "type": "textarea",
            "instructions": "",
            "required": 0,
            "conditional_logic": 0,
            "wrapper": {
                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "default_value": "At the beginning of each project, we create a private chat with the architecture team (the number of architects depends on the complexity of the drawings), the Project Manager, the Head of the Architecture Department, and the client. <strong>Our team is available 24\/7<\/strong> to ensure smooth communication and support throughout the project. With over 8 years of experience in developing drawings using BIM technology, we can seamlessly integrate into your workflow, reducing the workload on your architects and designers. Our architects work harmoniously with <strong>Revit, AutoCAD, SketchUp and Archicad<\/strong>, enabling efficient and high-quality project execution.",
