            },
            "default_value": "<p><strong>Arrange a call<\/strong> with business development manager Maverick Frame to learn more about our terms, values, employees and cases:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Get to know our company's approach to creating <strong>highly accurate drawings<\/strong><\/li>\r\n<li>Take a look at <strong>real projects<\/strong> completed by our architects<\/li>\r\n<li>Show us your technical specification, and we will estimate the <strong>deadline and price <\/strong>for your project<\/li>\r\n<li>Find out <strong>which of our services<\/strong> could be useful to you now or in the future.<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>",
