                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "default_value": "Our team is made up of incredible individuals, each with their own passions, from fishing to floristry. But we all share one thing in common – we are recognized experts in our field. These professionals have dedicated their lives to BIM design and modeling, with over 8 years of experience in architecture and over 10 years in the construction industry. All our architects hold university degrees and have completed numerous Graphisoft courses to gain international recognition for their skills. We participate in exhibitions, competitions, and create podcasts to explain the most interesting aspects of our field. Check out your team here.",
